# Contentful & SEO

- Fetch with `useAsyncData` + `$contentful.getEntries`; stable keys (`contentful-categories`, etc.).
- Prefer Composition API; avoid resurrecting commented Pinia store unless caching is clearly needed.
- Every public page: `useSeoMeta` / `useHead` with unique title + description (no "Placeholder description").
- Product/news: derive meta from Contentful fields when present; fall back to sensible defaults from `docs/brand-facts.md`.
- Images: `https:` + Contentful URL, meaningful `alt`, lazy-load below fold.
- Plan for `sitemap` / `robots` / JSON-LD `Organization` (+ `Product` on product pages) in SEO phase — don't block UI on missing modules.
